              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Audience needed</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">None</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Yes</td></tr>
